    <string name="perm_background_blocked">Android will only offer “Allow all the time” after “while using” has been granted. Grant that first, then come back.</string>

    <string name="help_token">The token is the value of PHONE_BRIDGE_TOKEN in ~/.config/claire/keys.json on the laptop. Print it there with:\npython -m claire.phone keys show PHONE_BRIDGE_TOKEN --reveal</string>
    <string name="help_battery">Android\'s do-not-kill list and MIUI\'s Autostart are what keep a listening service alive with the screen off.</string>

